      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "     PVC (Plastic) Sewer Pipes\r\n-------------------------------------------------\nCommon
    types: PVC, ABS, HDPE \u2014 all widely used in modern residential and commercial
    sewer lines\r\n\r\nAdvantages:\r\n\r\nCorrosion resistance: PVC does not rust
    or corrode, even in harsh chemical environments \n\r\nLightweight & easy to install:
    Easier handling, faster installation, and lower labor costs \n\r\nLong lifespan:
    Often lasts decades with minimal maintenance\n\r\nRoot resistance: Less prone
    to tree root intrusion compared to older materials like clay or cast iron \n\r\nCost-effective:
    Lower initial material and installation costs \nDisadvantages:\r\n\r\nTemperature
    sensitivity: PVC can soften or degrade at high temperatures \n\r\nUV exposure:
    Outdoor PVC can degrade if not protected from sunlightPlasco Pipes & Fittings.\r\n\nRigidity:
    Less flexible than some plastics, requiring precise slope and support"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e498d1c8094910479dc3e1b768306a4, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 2e498d1c8094910479dc3e1b768306a4, type: 2}
